From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:59:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 3070: day one writes first and in its own words (switch OFF,
 for Misho's yes)

Measured on 71 day-one runs over 4 days: 31 had a first question refused
by the content guards and rewritten, 33 searched before writing to anyone;
approval to the first sent question had a median of 73 s. DAY_ONE_FIRST_PASS
says up front what the guards check afterwards and puts the questions
before the searches, in ka/en/ru/es. MODEL-FACING (D44):
DAY_ONE_FIRST_PASS_ON = false until Misho says yes to the exact text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
